    "body": "## Release Notes\r\n\r\n## Features\r\n\r\n- Much better error messages. @iphydf (#137)\r\n- Add a function to inline all Group ast nodes. @iphydf (#135)\r\n- add Bifunctor instances for AST nodes and comments. @iphydf (#134)\r\n\r\n## Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- Correctly parse `*func()`. @iphydf (#136)\r\n\r\n## Documentation\r\n\r\n- Add cimple language peculiarities doc; add support for _Owned. @iphydf (#133)\r\n\r\n## Maintenance (Refactoring)\r\n\r\n- Simplify array AST, remove CompoundExpr, add QuickCheck instances @iphydf (#138)\r\n",
